WEBVTT

00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:01.387
OpenComputer

00:00:01.470 --> 00:00:02.472
an open-source

00:00:02.555 --> 00:00:04.170
self-hostable alternative

00:00:03.982 --> 00:00:04.736
to Devin

00:00:05.262 --> 00:00:06.629
OpenComputer is an

00:00:06.465 --> 00:00:07.903
open-source cloud coding

00:00:07.715 --> 00:00:08.811
agent that teams

00:00:08.623 --> 00:00:09.754
task from Slack

00:00:09.920 --> 00:00:10.615
it works on

00:00:10.427 --> 00:00:11.417
its own VM

00:00:11.335 --> 00:00:12.490
and delivers results

00:00:12.302 --> 00:00:13.563
as pull requests

00:00:13.587 --> 00:00:14.483
and can run

00:00:14.295 --> 00:00:15.002
in your own

00:00:14.814 --> 00:00:15.757
AWS

00:00:15.793 --> 00:00:17.266
GCP or Azure

00:00:17.078 --> 00:00:17.738
account

00:00:18.262 --> 00:00:19.476
You mention Computer

00:00:19.288 --> 00:00:20.066
in a Slack

00:00:19.878 --> 00:00:20.443
thread

00:00:20.573 --> 00:00:21.717
watch and steer

00:00:21.528 --> 00:00:22.070
it while it

00:00:21.882 --> 00:00:22.896
works and get

00:00:22.708 --> 00:00:23.438
a PR at

00:00:23.250 --> 00:00:24.016
the end

00:00:24.542 --> 00:00:25.532
The team claims

00:00:25.344 --> 00:00:26.499
it opens PRs

00:00:26.323 --> 00:00:27.018
3 .

00:00:26.830 --> 00:00:28.079
3x faster than

00:00:27.891 --> 00:00:28.728
Devin in its

00:00:28.540 --> 00:00:29.530
own benchmark

00:00:30.054 --> 00:00:31.068
Full story on

00:00:30.879 --> 00:00:31.775
the dashboard
